 - Display settings offer light grey, dark grey, and solid saved highlights, with contrasting text and a White option in Dark Mode.

 - Library and Home cover grids show saved reading percentages in high-contrast badges.
+
+- Custom sleep-screen rotation accepts JPEG, PNG, and the first frame of GIF images alongside BMPs.

 - The reader’s swipe-down drawer has a Library shortcut. Display → Frontlight offers independent black border widths from 0 to 16 pixels on each edge to mask light leakage.

